sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    Note over P,UI: Only after UC-01: with no track loaded the selectors are empty.
    P->>UI: choose a line, then a wayside
    UI->>S: selectLine(name), then selectController(id)
    alt unknown wayside
        S-->>UI: raise KeyError, selection unchanged
    else a wayside of a loaded line
        S->>M: line(name), controllers
        M-->>S: return the LineLayout and the TrackControllers
        S->>S: _load_buffer_from_controller()
        S->>W: program, file_name, iteration
        W-->>S: return the committed Program, or None
        S->>S: _load_buffer_from_controller internal: buffer := program.source, or empty. Uncommitted edits are dropped.
        S-->>UI: emit selectionChanged, bufferChanged, controllerChanged
        UI-->>P: editor, file list, block grid and header for this wayside
    end
